      "created_at": "2015-12-02T14:51:00.000Z",
      "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"Silverleaf\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/silverleaf/48/2332_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Silverleaf:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<div><b>Pydro wrote:</b><br><blockquote>Puerto Rico......the game or the territory?\n&nbsp;\n</blockquote></div>\nYes.\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>In the Brittish Empire they are the same thing.</p>\n<p>(now I want a game about taxing and oppressing spoiled and entitled American colonists)</p>\n<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"Rabit\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/rabit/48/5774_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Rabit:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>World peace…</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>I hear <a href=\"http://IronLegacy.com\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">IronLegacy.com</a> is running a crowdfunding campaign for that.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>For Christmas I want my family together (unlikely) and a fresh supply of pepper jelly.</p>",
